      "description": "Isispharma Urelia 10 150ml \n\nExfoliating moisturizing cream\nScaly skin. Hyperkeratosis\n\nWith Urelia 10 exfoliating moisturizing cream, take daily action against scaling and discomfort of the skin caused by hyperkeratosis.\n \nThe combination of moisturizing and exfoliating active ingredients helps to gently rid the skin of scales while providing deep hydration and relief.\n\nFragrance-free, this cream guarantees high tolerance and is suitable for the entire family, including pregnant women.\n\nDirections:\nOn the face and body\nIts creamy and comfortable texture makes for easy and enjoyable application. Apply 2 times a day onto clean, dry skin in affected areas.\n\nIngredients:\nAQUA (WATER), GLYCERIN, UREA, PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM (MINERAL OIL), BUTYLENE GLYCOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, CERA ALBA (BEESWAX), CYCLOPENTASILOXANE, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, DICAPRYLYL ETHER, POLYGLYCERYL-4 ISOSTEARATE, CYCLOHEXASILOXANE, CETYL PEG/PPG-10/1 DIMETHICONE, HEXYL LAURATE, BEHENOXY DIMETHICONE, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, DIMETHICONE, METHYL METHACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, SODIUM CHLORIDE, LACTIC ACID, CHLORPHENESIN, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, PSEUDOALTEROMONAS FERMENT EXTRACT, XANTHAN GUM, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, SILICA, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, ALANINE, PROLINE, SERINE, SODIUM PHOSPHATE, TOCOPHEROL, GLYCINE SOJA (SOYBEAN) OIL, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRA-DI-T-BUTYL HYDROXYHYDROCINNAMATE, CITRIC ACID",
